{{!< default}}
{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     blog.hbs — the /blog/ index. Ported from NSDS blog-listing.html.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     routes.yaml mounts the catch-all collection here, so this is the listing
     for EVERY post until a narrower collection claims some of them. Posts
     themselves still live at /{slug}/ — the mount moved, the permalink did
     not; see the note in routes.yaml.

     ── WHY THIS EXISTS RATHER THAN JUST USING index.hbs ─────────────────────
     index.hbs stays as Ghost's generic fallback for anything routes.yaml does
     not name, and it is deliberately plain. This one is allowed to be the
     blog's own front page — its own heading, its own feed link, its own empty
     state — without that styling leaking onto every unrouted listing.

     THE SIDEBAR IS A POST-LEVEL DECISION, NOT A LISTING ONE. #hide-sidebar
     applies to a single post's reading page (partials/post/article.hbs); an
     index has no article to sit beside. A listing that grew a sidebar would
     be competing with its own grid for the same horizontal space.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<section class="ns-band ns-band--tight">
    <div class="ns-band__inner">
        <div class="ns-band__head ns-band__head--between">
            <div>
                <span class="ns-kicker">{{t "Writing"}}</span>
                <h1 class="ns-band__title">{{t "The blog"}}</h1>
                <p class="ns-band__lede">{{t "Lessons, teardowns and notes from building on the platform — written as they ship."}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ns-band__actions">
                <a class="ns-btn ns-btn--outline ns-btn--sm" href="{{@site.url}}/blog/rss/">{{> "icons/rss"}} RSS</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#if posts}}
            <div class="ns-blog-grid">
                {{#foreach posts}}{{> "post-card"}}{{/foreach}}
            </div>
            {{> "pagination"}}
        {{else}}
            {{> "empty" title=(t "Nothing published yet")}}
        {{/if}}
    </div>
</section>
